{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must obtain food and water to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hunt creatures and obtain their transformation cards, which you can use to transform into the corresponding creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has different abilities and survival methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All food has an expiration date, and after expiration, it becomes toxic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the [WASD] keys on your keyboard to move around, and the mouse to control the camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set the key bindings to your preference.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948830?t=1756424221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948830?t=1756424221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948830/b9b79eb99949a24096ff457e40e19eaedc6f79ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756424221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948830/b9b79eb99949a24096ff457e40e19eaedc6f79ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756424221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must obtain food and water to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hunt creatures and obtain their transformation cards, which you can use to t